WEBVTT

00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:24.830
It doesn't look like anyone lives here.

00:00:26.620 --> 00:00:29.520
Excuse me! Is anybody here?!

00:00:32.860 --> 00:00:34.920
This is just a rock.

00:00:36.230 --> 00:00:38.390
A rock that someone has shaped into a house?

00:00:39.270 --> 00:00:42.240
This house over here is just a rock too!

00:00:42.700 --> 00:00:45.940
It looks like someone built this whole town,

00:00:47.180 --> 00:00:49.300
and then just left it.

00:00:55.150 --> 00:00:57.780
Dad! Mom!

00:00:59.790 --> 00:01:00.880
Those backpacks!

00:01:07.860 --> 00:01:11.420
I'm sure of it! That's got to be Mom and Dad!

00:01:11.530 --> 00:01:12.500
Wait up!

00:01:13.070 --> 00:01:15.160
Ai! Yu! Don't be in such a rush!

00:01:15.270 --> 00:01:16.900
Acting without thinking is dangerous!

00:01:44.330 --> 00:01:50.130
Daichi ni sosogu yoake

00:01:44.330 --> 00:01:50.130
The light of dawn pours over the vast Earth

00:01:52.010 --> 00:01:57.640
Tabidatsu toki wo tsugeru

00:01:52.010 --> 00:01:57.640
And marks the beginning of our journey

00:01:59.610 --> 00:02:06.750
Mirai wo mezashi kaketeyuku kaze

00:01:59.610 --> 00:02:06.750
With our eyes on the future

00:02:07.220 --> 00:02:12.850
Kono mune ni suikonda

00:02:07.220 --> 00:02:12.850
I deeply breathe in the rushing wind

00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:22.490
Yume dake wo kizamitsuketa hitomi

00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:22.490
The eyes that could only speak in dreams

00:02:24.370 --> 00:02:30.000
Bokura ni yuku michi wo ataeru

00:02:24.370 --> 00:02:30.000
Presented us with the path we're to take

00:02:31.910 --> 00:02:35.710
Fly to the Neverland

00:02:31.910 --> 00:02:35.710
Fly to the Neverland

00:02:35.780 --> 00:02:45.220
Kagiri nai yuuki wo mezamesasete

00:02:35.780 --> 00:02:45.220
Awaken the unlimited courage inside of us

00:02:55.000 --> 00:02:58.170
Welcome to the night of Wonderland.

00:02:59.610 --> 00:03:03.200
I am Fabula, your guide.

00:03:05.080 --> 00:03:07.840
People continue working on
a project that never ends.

00:03:10.320 --> 00:03:13.080
The Chaos trap set for them by Oscha...

00:03:16.990 --> 00:03:19.190
The werewolf, Lou,

00:03:19.290 --> 00:03:22.100
who has decided to put everything behind her

00:03:22.100 --> 00:03:24.530
and go off in search of the Black Wind.

00:03:26.870 --> 00:03:31.310
Where will the fate of the lost
travelers bring them next?

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:51.420
It opened.

00:03:52.360 --> 00:03:54.330
Don't let your guard down.

00:03:57.600 --> 00:04:02.400
Mom? Dad? It's Yu and Ai!

00:04:02.940 --> 00:04:04.800
If you're here, say something!

00:04:08.310 --> 00:04:09.210
A piano?

00:04:09.840 --> 00:04:11.400
I knew they were here!

00:04:12.310 --> 00:04:13.540
Yu, wait!

00:04:14.250 --> 00:04:15.610
Mom! Dad!

00:04:19.450 --> 00:04:23.950
Mom, Dad, aren't you here?

00:04:35.700 --> 00:04:38.260
Was it just that drop of water playing the piano?

00:04:39.170 --> 00:04:40.740
Let's get out of here.

00:04:40.740 --> 00:04:42.230
I have a bad feeling about this.

00:04:43.340 --> 00:04:45.710
Which way was the exit?

00:04:46.210 --> 00:04:48.440
Yu, you have no sense of direction!

00:04:49.320 --> 00:04:52.880
I think I might be a little lost too.

00:04:57.360 --> 00:04:59.590
We've ended up in a strange place.

00:04:59.690 --> 00:05:01.820
What kind of seeds are these?

00:05:02.560 --> 00:05:06.520
Aren't they chili peppers?
They look super spicy.

00:05:19.110 --> 00:05:20.010
Chobi!

00:05:32.330 --> 00:05:33.450
Chobi!

00:05:33.860 --> 00:05:36.020
No! We have to stick together!

00:05:36.130 --> 00:05:37.760
Don't go!

00:05:41.970 --> 00:05:44.700
Don't leave me!

00:05:49.510 --> 00:05:50.640
Who's there?

00:05:51.950 --> 00:05:53.240
Is somebody there?

00:06:03.460 --> 00:06:06.360
Please, take me with you.

00:06:08.660 --> 00:06:10.770
Who in the world is this kid?

00:06:10.770 --> 00:06:12.230
His spirit is different from a human's.

00:06:12.970 --> 00:06:16.300
But it feels so familiar somehow.

00:06:16.600 --> 00:06:19.730
Chobi! Sis!

00:06:22.040 --> 00:06:24.010
Mom? Dad?

00:06:26.710 --> 00:06:29.180
I see, so your name is Sagi.

00:06:29.280 --> 00:06:34.560
I was in a different place, and
I was sucked up by a light.

00:06:34.560 --> 00:06:37.890
Then I found myself here with no way out.

00:06:38.660 --> 00:06:42.190
You can relax now. We'll get you out of here.

00:06:42.630 --> 00:06:47.530
I was left behind before, and
I've been alone ever since.

00:06:49.040 --> 00:06:52.340
Don't worry, I won't abandon you
or leave you here.

00:06:53.510 --> 00:06:54.870
Shall we continue on together?

00:06:58.910 --> 00:07:03.010
Mom? Dad? Are you here?

00:07:25.570 --> 00:07:26.940
That really hurt!

00:07:27.380 --> 00:07:29.430
Chobi dragged me all over the place

00:07:29.540 --> 00:07:32.010
and now he's gone off
someplace by himself.

00:07:38.190 --> 00:07:41.250
No! Stay away from me!

00:08:12.290 --> 00:08:14.850
Are you going to leave me all alone again?

00:08:17.460 --> 00:08:20.690
No, why? I wouldn't do that.

00:08:24.730 --> 00:08:25.820
Again?

00:08:29.340 --> 00:08:33.300
Why is he looking at me like that?

00:09:04.840 --> 00:09:05.640
Wait!

00:09:11.450 --> 00:09:15.040
I wonder what this familiar feeling is?

00:09:16.850 --> 00:09:20.120
I must have felt Sagi's spirit before.

00:09:20.790 --> 00:09:22.120
But where?

00:09:23.860 --> 00:09:25.160
What's wrong?

00:09:26.730 --> 00:09:30.560
Hey, Sagi, have we ever met before?

00:09:32.300 --> 00:09:35.200
I remembered you, Lisa.

00:09:36.540 --> 00:09:39.200
I'm sorry for not remembering you.

00:09:39.310 --> 00:09:42.140
Did we meet in some town in Wonderland?

00:09:43.180 --> 00:09:46.170
I've been waiting to see you again for so long.

00:09:49.080 --> 00:09:50.710
You're not going to leave me?

00:09:53.150 --> 00:09:55.250
Why do you keep saying that?

00:09:55.760 --> 00:09:58.490
I would never leave you here all by yourself!

00:09:59.760 --> 00:10:00.890
Really?

00:10:01.600 --> 00:10:03.000
I promise.

00:10:19.210 --> 00:10:23.310
Where have you gone, Mom and Dad?

00:10:39.100 --> 00:10:40.230
Where are we?

00:10:45.270 --> 00:10:48.110
Are you two okay? You're not hurt, are you?

00:10:49.280 --> 00:10:51.300
It's about time you guys showed up!

00:10:52.280 --> 00:10:54.610
You certainly have no manners,

00:10:54.720 --> 00:10:59.150
looking at my Hughug baby
and screaming like that.

00:11:00.290 --> 00:11:02.150
Isn't that right, my little Hughug?

00:11:02.820 --> 00:11:05.960
Hughug? It's got a person's face.

00:11:05.960 --> 00:11:11.330
Right, this is my little Hughug baby.
I told you about it before.

00:11:11.330 --> 00:11:14.430
Remember when I told you
I'd Hughug you to death?

00:11:19.370 --> 00:11:20.810
Could that be Omega?

00:11:20.910 --> 00:11:21.970
Omega?

00:11:22.680 --> 00:11:26.610
That's right. I was just in the middle
of searching for Omega

00:11:26.710 --> 00:11:30.210
with my special automatic
searching device, Walnut.

00:11:44.900 --> 00:11:47.330
What in the world is this junk?!

00:11:48.740 --> 00:11:53.700
Unbelievable! All he does is find and
bring back these weird things!

00:11:53.810 --> 00:11:58.540
I can never quite trust the things
that Oscha makes.

00:11:59.380 --> 00:12:03.840
Weird things? So I'm something weird too.

00:12:04.490 --> 00:12:07.990
Were you brought here by that thing, too?!

00:12:07.990 --> 00:12:11.480
Was I left alone because I am too weird?

00:12:12.230 --> 00:12:15.250
Is that why you didn't take me with you?

00:12:15.760 --> 00:12:18.290
Sagi, you're not weird at all!

00:12:19.070 --> 00:12:20.530
Do you mean that?

00:12:20.770 --> 00:12:24.070
You're a very good boy. I can tell!

00:12:24.740 --> 00:12:27.670
Did you miss me?

00:12:29.210 --> 00:12:31.610
Quit your infantile complaining!

00:12:31.710 --> 00:12:34.340
I was right in the middle of talking to you!

00:12:34.450 --> 00:12:36.580
I'm going to Hughug you right now!

00:12:48.960 --> 00:12:49.860
Chobi!

00:12:50.330 --> 00:12:52.530
How rude of you!

00:12:53.470 --> 00:12:57.440
I am Herba, one of the Four Lords of Gaudium.

00:12:57.440 --> 00:13:00.310
Don't underestimate me, or
I'll make you regret it!

00:13:00.310 --> 00:13:03.640
Don't worry, I'll make sure to get us out of here!

00:13:04.110 --> 00:13:06.170
Get out? From here?

00:13:09.380 --> 00:13:10.850
That's impossible,

00:13:10.850 --> 00:13:16.760
because this entire place is made of Walnuts!

00:13:16.860 --> 00:13:18.980
Where are our mother and father?!

00:13:19.460 --> 00:13:20.790
What?

00:13:20.900 --> 00:13:23.190
We saw them come in here!

00:13:23.300 --> 00:13:26.030
Oh, are you talking about these guys?

00:13:34.410 --> 00:13:36.570
They have Mom and Dad's backpacks!

00:13:37.180 --> 00:13:39.370
Where did you find those backpacks?

00:13:40.380 --> 00:13:41.540
Let me see...

00:13:42.080 --> 00:13:43.140
Tell us!

00:13:44.450 --> 00:13:46.510
I totally forgot.

00:13:47.220 --> 00:13:52.180
It's about time our little chat came to an end.

00:13:52.760 --> 00:13:55.190
It's Hughug time!

00:14:07.640 --> 00:14:11.980
Oh, no, not again. I'm right in
the middle of something.

00:14:12.980 --> 00:14:16.380
I don't suppose you finally found
Omega for real this time?!

00:14:28.900 --> 00:14:30.830
Oscha, you idiot!

00:14:30.830 --> 00:14:34.360
Your searching device
went and caught my Magun baby!

00:14:34.900 --> 00:14:36.800
Soil is my power!

00:15:05.400 --> 00:15:07.890
The Magun has thawed!

00:15:13.040 --> 00:15:15.740
The appropriate Soil to use
against you has been decided!

00:15:19.550 --> 00:15:23.180
The anger that mows down everything,
Storm Blue!

00:15:29.220 --> 00:15:34.290
Oh no, this doesn't look good.
I'm out of here!

00:15:35.330 --> 00:15:39.270
The one that erases all color,
Ash Gray!

00:15:43.740 --> 00:15:48.170
And finally, the one that drops into
infinite darkness, Silent Black!

00:16:05.330 --> 00:16:09.490
Come! I summon you, Atmos!

00:16:37.190 --> 00:16:38.560
I can't hold on!

00:16:39.030 --> 00:16:40.930
We're gonna get sucked in!

00:16:42.800 --> 00:16:44.090
Lisa!

00:16:46.230 --> 00:16:47.130
Sagi!

00:16:50.140 --> 00:16:52.610
Grab on! Hurry!

00:16:53.670 --> 00:16:57.370
Are you going to take me with you?

00:16:57.680 --> 00:16:59.410
Of course!

00:16:59.410 --> 00:17:01.350
Hurry up and grab my hand!

00:17:02.220 --> 00:17:05.670
You should give the Chocobo
a Dead Pepper to eat.

00:17:06.820 --> 00:17:08.380
Dead Pepper?

00:17:09.020 --> 00:17:13.460
Do you remember in that room where
you found me? That red pepper.

00:17:15.030 --> 00:17:19.690
Ai, tell Poshepocket to give us
a Dead Pepper!

00:17:19.800 --> 00:17:20.890
What's that?

00:17:21.000 --> 00:17:22.200
Please just hurry!

00:17:23.040 --> 00:17:27.060
She said a Dead Pepper!
You'd better get it right this time!

00:17:48.400 --> 00:17:50.260
Everyone, hold on tight!

00:17:51.230 --> 00:17:55.930
Sagi! I promised you, I won't leave you alone!

00:17:56.500 --> 00:17:57.660
Lisa...

00:18:36.540 --> 00:18:38.100
There's nothing left.

00:18:38.780 --> 00:18:43.680
The town, the monsters, that guy...

00:18:43.680 --> 00:18:44.850
Sagi?!

00:18:44.850 --> 00:18:47.720
What?! Where is Sagi?

00:18:48.320 --> 00:18:49.690
Sagi?

00:18:50.260 --> 00:18:52.620
There was a boy with us, remember?

00:18:53.090 --> 00:18:55.630
I didn't see anyone like that.

00:18:55.630 --> 00:18:56.860
Where was he?

00:18:58.100 --> 00:19:01.760
He's not here? But that can't be.

00:19:02.900 --> 00:19:04.670
Are you sure you weren't dreaming?

00:19:06.270 --> 00:19:11.940
Sagi! Sagi!

00:19:12.610 --> 00:19:15.050
Didn't I tell you that we'd leave together?!

00:19:15.050 --> 00:19:16.710
Sagi!

00:19:27.960 --> 00:19:29.260
A sagiso...

00:19:32.470 --> 00:19:37.130
When I was a little girl, we had a
sagiso blooming in our garden.

00:19:38.170 --> 00:19:43.670
It was so cute that I talked to it
every day and took care of it.

00:19:44.480 --> 00:19:48.970
But one day, we moved to
the neighboring country.

00:19:50.080 --> 00:19:55.040
I was sad, but I still left the sagiso behind.

00:19:57.360 --> 00:19:58.920
That was you, wasn't it?

00:19:59.890 --> 00:20:05.060
You came all the way to see me
and I didn't even recognize you.

00:20:05.170 --> 00:20:08.400
I'm sorry, Sagi, I'm so sorry.

00:20:11.570 --> 00:20:15.470
My mother once told me something.

00:20:16.280 --> 00:20:19.010
In the language of flowers,

00:20:19.110 --> 00:20:21.950
sagiso means ''my thoughts will
follow you into your dreams.''

00:20:23.250 --> 00:20:25.050
Into your dreams...

00:20:53.980 --> 00:20:55.720
Nodo ga karakara desu

00:20:53.980 --> 00:20:55.720
I am so thirsty

00:20:55.720 --> 00:20:57.080
Taihen nan desu

00:20:55.720 --> 00:20:57.080
It's really getting bad

00:20:57.080 --> 00:20:59.210
Kono mune ookaji desu

00:20:57.080 --> 00:20:59.210
It's burning up inside of me

00:20:59.820 --> 00:21:02.560
Kimi wo hitome mita

00:20:59.820 --> 00:21:02.560
My heart skipped a beat

00:21:02.560 --> 00:21:05.460
Shunkan bibi tto kita

00:21:02.560 --> 00:21:05.460
When I laid eyes on you

00:21:05.460 --> 00:21:07.130
Goumon no you desu

00:21:05.460 --> 00:21:07.130
It's just like torture

00:21:07.130 --> 00:21:08.560
Taekirenai desu

00:21:07.130 --> 00:21:08.560
I can't take it

00:21:08.560 --> 00:21:10.590
Kimi ni koi shite kara

00:21:08.560 --> 00:21:10.590
Ever since I fell in love with you

00:21:11.400 --> 00:21:14.070
Itsumo kimi to nita

00:21:11.400 --> 00:21:14.070
My heart skips a beat whenever

00:21:14.070 --> 00:21:16.560
Kamigata ni ha to suru

00:21:14.070 --> 00:21:16.560
I see a girl with hair like yours

00:21:17.000 --> 00:21:20.640
Douka kamisama

00:21:17.000 --> 00:21:20.640
Please, God

00:21:20.640 --> 00:21:24.950
Kono boku ni tsubasa kudasai yo

00:21:20.640 --> 00:21:24.950
Can you please give me wings?

00:21:24.950 --> 00:21:28.480
Kore kare kimi dake wo motto tsuyoku

00:21:24.950 --> 00:21:28.480
From now on, my thoughts of you

00:21:28.480 --> 00:21:31.110
Omotchatte kirakira

00:21:28.480 --> 00:21:31.110
Will only shine and grow stronger

00:21:31.320 --> 00:21:34.120
Tsutaetai koto ippai

00:21:31.320 --> 00:21:34.120
There's so much I want to tell you

00:21:34.120 --> 00:21:37.120
Jikan ga tarinai nai ai ai

00:21:34.120 --> 00:21:37.120
There's not enough time left in the world

00:21:37.120 --> 00:21:39.960
Boku no hitomi ni wa mou

00:21:37.120 --> 00:21:39.960
You are now the only person

00:21:39.960 --> 00:21:42.300
Kimi shika utsuranai

00:21:39.960 --> 00:21:42.300
That my eyes can see

00:21:42.300 --> 00:21:45.000
Kitai wa kore kara

00:21:42.300 --> 00:21:45.000
Now I've got my hopes set high

00:21:45.000 --> 00:21:48.200
Nani kara nani made omoikitchatte

00:21:45.000 --> 00:21:48.200
All of these thoughts are too much for me

00:21:48.200 --> 00:21:51.140
Sa subete wo butsukeyou

00:21:48.200 --> 00:21:51.140
So I'm just going to spill my guts

00:21:51.240 --> 00:21:57.110
Seikai wa dare ni mo wakanai ai ai ai ai

00:21:51.240 --> 00:21:57.110
Nobody knows the right answer

00:21:57.110 --> 00:21:59.910
Atama no naka de wa mou

00:21:57.110 --> 00:21:59.910
I'm already celebrating my joy

00:21:59.910 --> 00:22:02.280
Shukufuku no kurakkaa

00:21:59.910 --> 00:22:02.280
On the inside

00:22:02.280 --> 00:22:05.250
Nani ka ga hajimaru

00:22:02.280 --> 00:22:05.250
Something is going to start

00:22:05.250 --> 00:22:07.990
Kitai wa kore kara

00:22:05.250 --> 00:22:07.990
Now I've got my hopes set high

00:22:07.990 --> 00:22:12.090
Nozomi wo mochimashou

00:22:07.990 --> 00:22:12.090
Let's never lose sight of our dreams

00:22:12.090 --> 00:22:13.460
All right!

00:22:12.090 --> 00:22:13.460
All right!

00:22:16.230 --> 00:22:19.100
Final Fantasy: Unlimited

00:22:23.040 --> 00:22:24.700
Here is my prophecy.

00:22:25.340 --> 00:22:29.540
Chocobo, chocobo, chocobo...

00:22:29.540 --> 00:22:31.640
Thank you so much for all of the memories.

00:22:32.350 --> 00:22:36.180
But now, Omega is coming once again.

00:22:40.990 --> 00:22:43.820
Next time, I'll return to offer you
my Unlimited guidance.
